flowchart LR
    A[Content idea / topic] --> B[AI draft generated]
    B --> C[Confidence score]
    C --> D{Above publish threshold?}
    D -- No --> E[Human review / edit]
    D -- Yes --> E
    E --> F[Approve / reject]
    F -- Approve --> G[Schedule or publish]
    F -- Reject --> H[Revise draft]
    G --> I[Live blog post]
    I --> J[Analytics + campaign distribution]
